(STANDARD OPERATING PROCEDURE) Tj T*
(Weighing and dispensing) Tj T*
(Document No.: SOP-QA-0020) Tj T*
(Revision: 02) Tj T*
(Effective date: 2024-06-21) Tj T*
(Site: Lakemoor) Tj T*
(Owner: Ben Brandt) Tj T*
(Approved by: Grace Nakamura) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(1 Purpose) Tj T*
(This procedure defines how weighing and dispensing is carried out at Lakemoor.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(2 Scope) Tj T*
(Applies to all weighing and dispensing activities in production and quality control at Lakemoor \(revised in revision 02\).) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(3 Responsibilities) Tj T*
(The process owner, Ben Brandt, maintains this procedure. Quality approves it.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(4 Procedure) Tj T*
(Step 1: Confirm the logbook entry.) Tj T*
(Step 2: Clean the equipment status label.) Tj T*
(Step 3: Document deviations to Quality within one day.) Tj T*
(Step 4: Escalate the area is free of previous materials, and record the result on form F-202.) Tj T*
(Step 5: Verify the result against the acceptance criterion.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(5 Records) Tj T*
(Records of weighing and dispensing are kept for five years after batch expiry.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(6 Revision history) Tj T*
(Revision   Change) Tj T*
(01         Revision 01: first issue.) Tj T*
(02         Revision 02: updated.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
